    {
        "user": "U07BW27EEHF",
        "type": "message",
        "ts": "1753482797.366329",
        "client_msg_id": "532b0c4e-d330-4888-bb5b-f8dd76c9285d",
        "text": "Thanks! And big thanks and congrats to Laura as well, who was hauling this thing over the finish line with me :sweat_smile:. Fingers crossed that we win... it looks like our story is one of seven finalists.\n\nWhen folks have been finalists\/won in the past, did they go to the awards ceremony? I think Madison and Yesi won last year. I'd probably prefer to sit out the additional travel, but at the same time idk if it's a bad look to not show up, especially if you end up winning an award and given that they offer travel stipends.\n\nFYI Lisa and Lila and Laura, I let Anh Gray know the story is a finalist.",
        "team": "T036YAYMK",
        "user_team": "T036YAYMK",
        "source_team": "T036YAYMK",
        "user_profile": {
            "avatar_hash": "49ac95eac7b2",
            "image_72": "https:\/\/avatars.slack-edge.com\/2024-07-08\/7392425454371_49ac95eac7b2c1d21792_72.png",
            "first_name": "Audrey",
            "real_name": "Audrey Brown",
            "display_name": "Audrey Brown",
            "team": "T036YAYMK",
            "name": "abrown",
            "is_restricted": false,
            "is_ultra_restricted": false
        },
        "thread_ts": "1753459722.488339",
        "parent_user_id": "U036YAYMM",
        "blocks": [
