                "elements": [
                    {
                        "type": "rich_text_section",
                        "elements": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "Thanks! And big thanks and congrats to Laura as well, who was hauling this thing over the finish line with me "
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "emoji",
                                "name": "sweat_smile",
                                "unicode": "1f605"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": ". Fingers crossed that we win... it looks like our story is one of seven finalists.\n\nWhen folks have been finalists\/won in the past, did they go to the awards ceremony? I think Madison and Yesi won last year. I'd probably prefer to sit out the additional travel, but at the same time idk if it's a bad look to not show up, especially if you end up winning an award and given that they offer travel stipends.\n\nFYI Lisa and Lila and Laura, I let Anh Gray know the story is a finalist."
                            }
